(632, '-mäpï³', '-mäpïch', 'mapich', 'mApI³', 'fist', 'puño', 'It is probable that the root mapich is composed of two roots, namely ma\r\n´hand´ and piqui ´close´ which is used about mouth, hand, etc., i.e. where\r\ntwo parts meet.\r\n'),
