(572, '-matel', '-matel', 'matel', 'mAtEl', 'rub', 'frotar', 'Evidence for the length of the vowels comes from modern dialects:\r\nin Pipil the second vowel is short, mätiloa; in Coatepec C.and Tetelcingo \r\nit is long, mätïloa.\r\n'),
