(634, '-mA²Owa', '-mAtzOhua', 'matzohua', 'mA²OwA', 'fold', 'doblar', 'We base our interpretation of the root as matzohua rather than matzoa on\r\nthe word tlamatzohualli; the derived noun from matzoa would be tlamatzolli.\r\n'),
