(1142, '-pInO', '-pInO', 'pino', 'pInO', 'alien', 'ajeno', NULL),
(859, '-pinol', '-pinol', 'pinol', 'pInOl', 'flour', 'harina', 'In the two attestations in Carochi´s Arte the second vowel , the o, is\r\nunmarked, but it is long in modern dialects, Coatepec Costales, La Huasteca,\r\nMecayapan, Pipil, Xalitla, Zacapoaxtla\r\n'),
