(24, '-pi²ä#1', '-pitzä', 'pitza', 'pI²A', 'thin (about something cylindrical)', 'delgado (de algo cilíndrico)', 'Evidence for the length of the two vowels comes from modern dialects:\r\nTetelcingo, Pipil, Coatepec C., Xalitla, etc.\r\n'),
