(138, '-tamal', '-tamal', 'tamal', 'tAmAl', 'tamale', 'tamale', 'Evidence for the length of the two vowels comes from modern dialects:\r\nTetelcingo, Zacapoaxtla, Xalitla, Mecayapan, Pipil, Cuatlamayan, San Pedro\r\nTlalcuapan, Ixhuatlancillo, Quacuila, Coatepec C.\r\n'),
