(202, '-tekpa#2', '-tecpa', 'tecpa', 'tEkpA', 'flint knife', 'pedernal', 'Evidence for the length of the vowels comes from modern dialects:\r\nLa Huasteca, Tetelcingo\r\n'),
(705, '-tekpä#1', '-tecpä', 'tecpa', 'tEkpA', 'in order, in a line', 'en orden', 'Evidence for the length of the vowels comes from modern dialects, La\r\nHuasteca, Tetelcingo, Zacapoaxtla.\r\n'),
