(922, '-tekpin', '-tecpin', 'tecpin', 'tEkpIn', 'flea', 'pulga', 'Evidence for the length of the vowels comes from modern dialects: La\r\nHuasteca, Mecayapan, Pipil, Tetelcingo, Zitlala.\r\n'),
(867, '-tëksis', '-tëcciz', 'tecciz', 'tEksIs', 'seashell', 'caracol', NULL),
(731, '-tël', '-tël', 'tel', 'tEl', 'but', 'pero', NULL),
(248, '-tema', '-tema', 'tema', 'tEmA', 'heat in oven', 'calentar en horno', 'We recognize three distinct roots:\r\n1) tema ´heat in oven´;\r\n2) tëmi, which underlies the word tëma, ´pour, put down (smthn. like corn)´;\r\n3) tëmi ´swell, be filled´.\r\nThis decision is based on Carochi´s observation (f.128r, p.532) concerning\r\nminimal pairs:\r\n\"Tëma nic, 1. larga, echar maiz, trigo, reales, &c. téma nic 1. breue, bañar\r\nen temazcal, assar en hornillo, ò barbacoa\".\r\nIt conflicts with Molina´s interpretation. He has two entries:\r\n\"Tema. nino. bañarse en temazcalli.\"\r\n\"Tema. nitla. echar o poner algo en alguna parte, assi como mayz. &c. o\r\ncozer algo en hornillo pequeño.\" (f.96v).\r\n'),
(1022, '-tëmal', '-tëmal', 'temal', 'tEmAl', 'pus', 'pus', NULL),
(249, '-tëmi#1', '-tëmi', 'temi', 'tEmI', 'swell; be filled', 'hinchar; llenarse', 'We recognize three distinct roots:\r\n1) tema ´heat in oven´;\r\n2) tëmi, which underlies the word tëma, ´pour, put down (smthn. like corn)´;\r\n3) tëmi ´swell, be filled´.\r\nThis decision is based on Carochi´s observation (f.128r, p.532) concerning\r\nminimal pairs:\r\n\"Tëma nic, 1. larga, echar maiz, trigo, reales, &c. téma nic 1. breue, bañar\r\nen temazcal, assar en hornillo, ò barbacoa\".\r\nIt conflicts with Molina´s interpretation. He has two entries:\r\n\"Tema. nino. bañarse en temazcalli.\"\r\n\"Tema. nitla. echar o poner algo en alguna parte, assi como mayz. &c. o\r\ncozer algo en hornillo pequeño.\" (f.96v).\r\n'),
(250, '-tëmi#2', '-tëmi', 'temi', 'tEmI', 'pour, put down', 'echar; poner junto', 'We recognize three distinct roots:\r\n1) tema ´heat in oven´;\r\n2) tëmi, which underlies the word tëma, ´pour, put down (smthn. like corn)´;\r\n3) tëmi ´swell, be filled´.\r\nThis decision is based on Carochi´s observation (f.128r, p.532) concerning\r\nminimal pairs:\r\n\"Tëma nic, 1. larga, echar maiz, trigo, reales, &c. téma nic 1. breue, bañar\r\nen temazcal, assar en hornillo, ò barbacoa\".\r\nIt conflicts with Molina´s interpretation. He has two entries:\r\n\"Tema. nino. bañarse en temazcalli.\"\r\n\"Tema. nitla. echar o poner algo en alguna parte, assi como mayz. &c. o\r\ncozer algo en hornillo pequeño.\" (f.96v).\r\n'),
