(2553, '-a´möl=wia', '-a´mölhuia', 'amolhuia', 'AmOlwIA', 'wash with soap', 'lavar con jabón', 'In Tetelcingo and Zacapoaxtla the verb amolhuia (a´mölwia) has the form\r\namohuia (a´mowia) with short o and no l, suggesting that the root is amo\r\n(a´mo).\r\n', 11, 2, 1, NULL, '=wi+´\r\n'),
