(1750, 6, 1, 22, '', '', '', '+ï-ïx-pan < señor don Toribio Silvestre fiscal iglesia > +ï-wän < Vicente Ramirez. Balthasar Pérez alguaciles iglesia > +ï-wän +ï-ïx-pan < Juan Aluaro. > -³än=e´ -ApsOl=ko', 'yispan señor Don turibio siluestre  fiscal yglesia yhua~ Vicente Ramirez. balthasar p~z alguaziles yglesia  yhua~ yispa~ J n aluaro. chane apçolco.', 'before Señor Don Toribio Silvestre, fiscal of the church, and Vicente Ramirez. Balthasar Pérez constables of the church and in the presence of Juan Aluaro, citizen of Apçolco.'),
